' Sequence Diagram Example
title "User Login Process"

actor User
participant "Web Interface" as UI
participant "Authentication Service" as Auth
participant "Database" as DB

User -> UI: Enter credentials
UI -> Auth: validateCredentials(username, password)
Auth -> DB: getUserByUsername(username)
DB --> Auth: User data
Auth -> Auth: verifyPassword(password, hashedPassword)

alt successful authentication
    Auth --> UI: Authentication successful
    UI -> Auth: createSession(userId)
    Auth --> UI: Session token
    UI --> User: Login successful, redirect to dashboard
else authentication failed
    Auth --> UI: Authentication failed
    UI --> User: Display error message
end

